        "cooked": "<p>Yes.</p><p>First: Is the girl from Blighted Streets or Vigilance Guise (WAY back when, over the forum)</p><p>\"No, Guise is Male.\"</p><p>Second, at Gathering of Heroes: Is Guise Thiago?</p><p>\"Nope!\"</p><p>Third, immediately following the second: Has Guise appeared in the game in any form up to this point?</p><p>\"Nope!\"</p>",
